Source: numa
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tijmen <38768749+simmmmm@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc (>= 1.92), gcc, pkgconf, libgtk-4-dev (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-dev (>= 1.5), libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/simmmmm/Numa
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: numa
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: RAW photo editor and library
 Numa is a RAW photo editor and library. Add a folder, cull the shoot,
 develop the frames you keep and export them. Your originals are never
 moved, copied or written to.
